@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 05. Supervisor Agent LangGraph4J Orchestration (Synced with Source, 2026-05-14)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 12

start

:Service layer HITL pre-check;
if (review required?) then (yes)
  :create WAITING_REVIEW task;
  :open review ticket;
  stop
endif

:Create RUNNING task;
:Load history/checkpoint/swarm via ExecutionStateLoader;
:Build typed graph input via SupervisorGraphInputBuilder;
:Invoke CompiledGraph;

#FFE7A8:PLAN node;
note right
<size:10>CallLLM</size>
end note

:SELECT node;
if (routing plan exists?) then (yes)
  :INVOKE node;
  :record invocation batch to SwarmState;
  :HANDOFF_EVALUATE node;
  if (accepted handoff exists?) then (yes)
    :HANDOFF_APPLY node;
  else (no)
    :keep original routing queue;
  endif
  :MERGE node;
  if (more plans?) then (yes)
    :loop back to SELECT;
  endif
else (no)
endif

:COMPOSE node entered;
#FFE7A8:Compose outside graph;
note right
<size:10>CallLLM</size>
end note
:Emit graph/routing summary via SummaryEmitter;
:Collect sync payload via ExecutionResultCollector (sync/resume only);
:Persist history/checkpoint/task state via PersistenceService;

stop

note right
Current graph contract
- nodes: plan, select, invoke, handoff_evaluate, handoff_apply, merge, compose
- no HITL wait node inside graph
- select -> (invoke | compose)
- invoke batch size is bounded by execution.maxConcurrency
- max iteration guard exists
- handoff is feature-flagged and policy-validated
- graph input assembly is outside graph
- summary/progress publish is outside graph
end note
@enduml
